WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.916
Faseeh: correct your recitation in a minute.

1
00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:07.582
Choose the surah you want to recite.

2
00:00:07.682 --> 00:00:11.169
Recite from the start of the surah as far as you like: Faseeh finds where you stopped.

3
00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:13.952
To start from another ayah, tap it.

4
00:00:14.052 --> 00:00:17.852
Tap “Hear the reciter” to hear the ayahs by Sheikh Muhammad Siddiq al-Minshawi.

5
00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:21.726
The word being recited is highlighted as you listen.

6
00:00:21.826 --> 00:00:25.364
Can't record right now? Upload a recorded file with “Upload my recording”.

7
00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:31.200
Tap “Start recording”, recite clearly, then stop the recording.

8
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.784
Faseeh analyses your recitation in a few seconds.

9
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:39.150
You see the share of correct words and the ayahs you recited; the word with a mistake is highlighted.

10
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:47.369
Tap the word to see its correct pronunciation written out, and where the letter is articulated.

11
00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:50.947
The Tajweed rule behind the mistake is shown too.

12
00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:57.647
Listen to it by the reciter: the word alone, or the whole ayah.

13
00:00:57.747 --> 00:01:01.670
“Play my recording” plays your recitation back, so you can compare.

14
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:07.207
In “Word pronunciation” you learn how to say any word, without recording.

15
00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:12.035
Faseeh is available in thirteen languages.

16
00:01:12.335 --> 00:01:15.438
Faseeh is an AI model that can make mistakes. It is not a substitute for a qualified teacher.
